 anonymous person, linked to nothing: PostHog rejects a whole"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"batch when one of its events has no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"distinct_id"},{"type":"text","text":". PostHog counts a person per "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"distinct_id"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so its unique users are sessions. The session is also sent as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$session_id"},{"type":"text","text":", which PostHog’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sessions and web analytics group events by ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionKey"},{"type":"text","text":" is the UUIDv7 they require); a record"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with no session has none. The record’s vendor identifier and trace context, and any other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"context value, aren’t sent."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Properties are read from the event’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BinaryCodable"},{"text":" form, which ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"text":" derives, through the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"types its schema in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"plan"},{"text":" lists: a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"text":" is a string; a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bool"},{"text":" a boolean; an integer, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Double"},{"text":" or a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Float"},{"text":" a number; a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Date"},{"text":" an ISO 8601 string, as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timestamp"},{"text":" is; a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UUID"},{"text":" an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"uppercase UUID string; an array an array; and an 